Rapidity — data sources and acknowledgements
============================================

The derived star catalog shipped with this project is a separate artifact under
CC BY-SA 4.0 (see LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt). Share-alike attaches to derivative
works of the data. A program that reads a data file is not a derivative of that
data; keeping the catalog a separate artifact keeps that boundary explicit.
See ARCHITECTURE.md §13.


HYG Stellar Database
--------------------
The star catalog is derived from the HYG database, itself a merge of the Hipparcos
catalog, the Yale Bright Star Catalog (5th ed.) and the Gliese Catalog of Nearby
Stars (3rd ed.).

  David Nash, HYG Stellar Database.
  https://github.com/astronexus/HYG-Database

Licensed CC BY-SA 4.0. Attribution is carried in the catalog artifact's own
LICENSE file as well as here.


